om\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\"]http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Were making preperations for our up and coming wedding yet we can&#039;t choose wether to get hitched in July or October. What&#039;s more, we truly need to choose soon. We live in Pa so July is exceptionally hot yet some of the time October can be extremely cool. Could you please let me know which you would favor if this would you say you was and why? Much obliged to you to such an extent!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;__________________&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/the-best-month-to-tie-the-knot\/\"]wedding month[\/url]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907120,"PostDate":1446621874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\" alt=\"The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Were making preperations for our up and coming wedding yet we can't choose wether to get hitched in July or October. What's more, we truly need to choose soon. We live in Pa so July is exceptionally hot yet some of the time October can be extremely cool. Could you please let me know which you would favor if this would you say you was and why? Much obliged to you to such an extent!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><br \/>\n<div>__________________<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/the-best-month-to-tie-the-knot\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding month<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddingsspirit2016@outlook.com","IpAddress":"122.178.80.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446621360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Rebccalewis","Id":285241,"Name":"Rebccalewis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79704,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03bb8ceaa50f18239116d081c8ff67de","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Rebccalewis\" post=\"1907120\" timestamp=\"1446621874\"]\n\n[img]http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg[\/img]\n\nWere making preperations for our up and coming wedding yet we can&#039;t choose wether to get hitched in July or October. What&#039;s more, we truly need to choose soon. We live in Pa so July is exceptionally hot yet some of the time October can be extremely cool. Could you please let me know which you would favor if this would you say you was and why? Much obliged to you to such an extent!\n\n\n\n__________________\n[url=\"http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/the-best-month-to-tie-the-knot\/\"]wedding month[\/url]\n[\/quote]@[member=\"Rebccalewis\"], which destination are youy thinking to host your wedding?  in the Riviera Maya Mexico, both july and October are pretty hot and humid.  its more what works for you.\n\n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1907156,"PostDate":1446688150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Rebccalewis, on 03 November 2015 - 11:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\" alt=\"The-Best-Month-to-Tie-the-Knot2.jpg\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Were making preperations for our up and coming wedding yet we can't choose wether to get hitched in July or October. What's more, we truly need to choose soon. We live in Pa so July is exceptionally hot yet some of the time October can be extremely cool. Could you please let me know which you would favor if this would you say you was and why? Much obliged to you to such an extent!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><br><div>__________________<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/the-best-month-to-tie-the-knot\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding month<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285241\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285241-rebccalewis\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rebccalewis<\/span><\/a>, 