> Time: 1454386618 / Tue, 02 Feb 2016 04:16:58 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79354&start=10&SessionId=b9a377d45f5586044df303558a0d2c49
> User Natasha28 (286090)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79354,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ebebaa33089411acd741c3f2d34adfc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RivieraBride15\" post=\"1899912\" timestamp=\"1436278656\"]\nHow are you all getting your stuff to your destinations?  Are you carrying it all with you?  Are any of you shipping anything?  Our theme is starfish and I have a bunch that we will be using in one way or another at the wedding, I&#039;m so afraid to pack it in a regular suitcase, so I am thinking now a carryon.  What is everyone else planning on doing?[\/quote]hey @[member=\"RivieraBride15\"],\n\nall the ladies here have given you some super great tips.  I also advice you not to ship anything here . so unreliable, or to avoid for your package arriving after the wedding.\n\nI am sure most of you ladies have heard of KatyMK  follow link. [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor?fref=ts\"]https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor?fref=ts[\/url]\n\nShe pretty much accepts to buy things from brides after their weddings, and also rents tons of decor details.  \nIn terms of all your extra luggage, spread your luggage among your bridal party or family.   Trust me you would be surprised on how many people are willing to assisting you with all your suitcase.   \n\nHappy Planning\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1900059,"PostDate":1436410863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RivieraBride15, on 07 July 2015 - 06:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>How are you all getting your stuff to your destinations?\u00a0 Are you carrying it all with you?\u00a0 Are any of you shipping anything?\u00a0 Our theme is starfish and I have a bunch that we will be using in one way or another at the wedding, I'm so afraid to pack it in a regular suitcase, so I am thinking now\u00a0a carryon.\u00a0 What is everyone else planning on doing?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>hey\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279902\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279902-rivierabride15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RivieraBride15<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>all the ladies here have given you some super great tips. \u00a0I also advice you not to ship anything here . so unreliable, or to avoid for your package arriving after the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am sure most of you ladies have heard of KatyMK \u00a0follow link. <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor?fref=ts' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...cedecor?fref=ts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>She pretty much accepts to buy things from brides after their weddings, and also rents tons of decor details. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In terms of all your extra luggage, spread your luggage among your bridal party or family. \u00a0 Trust me you would be surprised on how many people are willing to assisting you with all your suitcase. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79354,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b95b508a3b549c6678596aeb4c835c5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hey if its a destination wedding than y don&#039;t u buy starfish online and give the address of the location where you vill stay. that would so easier. no luggage to carry no no worry of getting any damage.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901872,"PostDate":1438758234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hey if its a destination wedding than y don't u buy starfish online and give the address of the location where you vill stay. that would so easier. no luggage to carry no no worry of getting any damage.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425100717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
