{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b29b24c3178fef7bd35279a32f3206ab","RawContent":"@[member=\"danielleesme\"] Congrats and officially welcome to the forum. Glad to see another BC bride [emoji4] I&#039;m also getting married in the Mayan Riviera about a month before you! \n\n\nI&#039;m no expert on Mexican customs rules, but I wouldn&#039;t be too worried about candies. Fresh stuff like fruit, meat, etc (or even dried versions), yes, but I think candy\/chocolate would be okay.  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908876,"PostDate":1451783161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283205\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283205-danielleesme\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">danielleesme<\/span><\/a> Congrats and officially welcome to the forum. Glad to see another BC bride [emoji4] I'm also getting married in the Mayan Riviera about a month before you! <br><br>\nI'm no expert on Mexican customs rules, but I wouldn't be too worried about candies. Fresh stuff like fruit, meat, etc (or even dried versions), yes, but I think candy\/chocolate would be okay.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cacb57869d973439500dd8d8ccfbb30d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Those mini pinatas&amp;nbsp;are soo adorable and I love the personalized m&amp;amp;m idea.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t think that you will have any issues with bringing the m&amp;amp;ms with you to Mexico. I brought all of my OOT bag contents with me to Mexico and I brought a ton of stuff including food items (candys etc) and I had no issues at all. I didn&#039;t bring receipts or anything with me because once I got to the point of a week before the wedding, it was honestly the last thing on my mind. At the end of the day, I don&#039;t think they will give anyone a hard time about harmless items like OOT bag contents :) It will all work out!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re 4 months away - that&#039;s so exciting!! :) Your big day will be here before you know it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909006,"PostDate":1452005269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Those mini pinatas\u00a0are soo adorable and I love the personalized m&m idea.<\/p>\n<p>I don't think that you will have any issues with bringing the m&ms with you to Mexico. I brought all of my OOT bag contents with me to Mexico and I brought a ton of stuff including food items (candys etc) and I had no issues at all. I didn't bring receipts or anything with me because once I got to the point of a week before the wedding, it was honestly the last thing on my mind. At the end of the day, I don't think they will give anyone a hard time about harmless items like OOT bag contents <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It will all work out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're 4 months away - that's so exciting!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Your big day will be here before you know it.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.250.247.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7822e4a7e1bf22acfe7b3833a410d036","RawContent":"Hi ladies! \n\n\nJoining the party late! I&#039;ve been on here on and off since last January. I&#039;m getting married May 30th in PDC. Just wondering if anyone is getting\/ \n\nGot married at the grand Hyatt playa del Carmen?!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909028,"PostDate":1452048689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies! <br><br>\nJoining the party late! I've been on here on and off since last January. I'm getting married May 30th in PDC. Just wondering if anyone is getting\/ <br>\nGot married at the grand Hyatt playa del Carmen?! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cdmuellerbarrera@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.160.162.44","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428882475,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"badgerbride","Id":282721,"Name":"badgerbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"172a3fbbf2c0c35b43af212dfb0dc718","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"badgerbride\"] May is a popular month to get married in Mexico,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I do have a bride getting married at the Grand Hyatt playa del carmen, but its not until the fall.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you have a specific question about the hotel? we love their beautiful grounds.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909043,"PostDate":1452072279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282721-badgerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">badgerbride<\/span><\/a> May is a popular month to get married in Mexico,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I do have a bride getting married at the Grand Hyatt playa del carmen, but its not until the fall.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you have a specific question about the hotel? we love their beautiful grounds.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.250.247.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5505f06ff60c437a33e6f5b61c58d281","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"dreamweddings\"]!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am in the process of picking out who will do my makeup and hair! so I was wondering about their spa services. I really don&#039;t want to pay a vendor fee to bring in an outside vendor, so I either want to go with their spa or go somewhere outside of the hotel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone has gotten married at the Hyatt and has photos of their hair and make up done by their spa LMK! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909263,"PostDate":1452484805,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a>!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am in the process of picking out who will do my makeup and hair! so I was wondering about their spa services. I really don't want to pay a vendor fee to bring in an outside vendor, so I either want to go with their spa or go somewhere outside of the hotel.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone has gotten married at the Hyatt and has photos of their hair and make up done by their spa LMK! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cdmuellerbarrera@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.160.162.44","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428882475,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"badgerbride","Id":282721,"Name":"badgerbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2bfe2ffecb41d11d3e8f0af75b46134","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"badgerbride\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lucky you, there &amp;nbsp;hotel is right in the hearts of playa, so this means you have some good options with walking distance. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;it all depends on what your budget is for hair and make up.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909271,"PostDate":1452503415,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282721-badgerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">badgerbride<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lucky you, there \u00a0hotel is right in the hearts of playa, so this means you have some good options with walking distance. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>it all depends on what your budget is for hair and make up.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.7.245.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79823,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa2d84808e3c3b6086a99d2971f963c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"], thanks for the hello!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Glad to hear that the MMs weren&#039;t a problem! Your suckers are an adorable idea! So cheesy that its so good!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding planning is coming along...haha, we are ordering bridesmaid dresses this weekend, and starting to order\/find decor options. I just found out that we are not allowed to use sparklers, so I have to find a Plan B.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your wedding is coming so soon! When do you leave?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909610,"PostDate":1452960673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a>, thanks for the hello!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Glad to hear that the MMs weren't a problem! Your suckers are an adorable idea! So cheesy that its so good!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding planning is coming along...haha, we are ordering bridesmaid dresses this weekend, and starting to order\/find decor options. I just found out that we are not allowed to use sparklers, so I have to find a Plan B.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your wedding is coming so soon! When do you leave?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;13;484\/st\/20160505\/e\/Wedding+%26lt%3B3+\/dt\/-3\/k\/b626\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"d_cossey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.7.245.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432307787,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283205.jpg?_r=1451686287","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"danielleesme","Id":283205,"Name":"danielleesme","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
