00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>*<span style=\"color:#800080;\">F<\/span><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">U<\/span><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\">T<\/span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">U<\/span><span style=\"color:#ee82ee;\">R<\/span><span style=\"color:#ffa500;\">E<\/span> <span style=\"color:#006400;\">M<\/span><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\">R<\/span><span style=\"color:#ee82ee;\">S<\/span> <span style=\"color:#b22222;\">T<\/span><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">O<\/span><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\">W<\/span><span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\">N<\/span><span style=\"color:#800080;\">S<\/span> \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"sadiekirby93@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.229.218","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436801822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283939.jpg?_r=1438893746","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sadiekirby93","Id":283939,"Name":"sadiekirby93","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79480,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by perianjay, 10 August 2015 - 11:19 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1439234345,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f33f9e1cca3ae837224ecbaf4b012a0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"sadiekirby93\"] What size are you? I&#039;m located in Markham\/Toronto and I have a dress for sale. No beading though.. it is all lace, but it&#039;s a stunning gown and you could always add a beaded belt.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902239,"PostDate":1439234323,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283939-sadiekirby93\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sadiekirby93<\/span><\/a> What size are you? I'm located in Markham\/Toronto and I have a dress for sale. No beading though.. it is all lace, but it's a stunning gown and you could always add a beaded belt.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"115.118.164.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79480,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b14acd31d5b9037eebca1ee44d4336a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think instead of buying a used wedding dress, you should buy a new one. You can buy it from shoppersfeed at reasonable price.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903038,"PostDate":1440159036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>I think instead of buying a used wedding dress, you should buy a new one. You can buy it from shoppersfeed at reasonable price.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"\n\t\t\t\t<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.shoppersfeed.com\/short-bridesmaid-dresses'>Turquoise bridesmaid dresses<\/a>\n\t\t<p>\u00a0","Email":"rayforlisa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"115.118.164.37","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440155654,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lisaray12","Id":284515,"Name":"lisaray12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.171.88.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79480,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d6a72042750be3e997caeefc59ba14b","RawContent":"@[member=\"sadiekirby93\"]\n\nIt would be helpful to have your dress size and height. As well the same for your bridesmaid so people will know if that have something that may fit. Also have you tried the Brides Project on Broadview ave they sell used, as well as new discontinued stock from dress boutiques at a crazy discounted price.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1903115,"PostDate":1440298598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283939-sadiekirby93\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sadiekirby93<\/span><\/a><br>\nIt would be helpful to have your dress size and height. As well the same for your bridesmaid so people will know if that have something that may fit. Also have you tried the Brides Project on Broadview ave they sell used, as well as new discontinued stock from dress boutiques at a crazy discounted price.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365792059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1448996983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.192.215.113","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79480,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f57d8546f123a8252f1a0fbeae76d4ed","RawContent":"Hi\n\n\nI have a dress for sale! It&#039;s Kitty Chen Florence. Size 6 which fits 0-8 bc it&#039;s corset. It looks great with a belt and is light for traveling. \n\n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/148140&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/148140&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903124,"PostDate":1440340044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi<br><br>\nI have a dress for sale! It's Kitty Chen Florence. Size 6 which fits 0-8 bc it's corset. It looks great with a belt and is lig